{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getKeyMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@RFIDManager@objc(cs)RFIDResult","text":"RFIDResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the fetch is successful, the data field of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult"},{"type":"text","text":" is Int."},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"如果获取成功，"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult"},{"type":"text","text":"的data字段为"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"English","type":"heading","text":"English","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The KeyMode parameter controls the trigger mode of the device’s scan key."},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"When KeyMode = 0, the key value 1 will be returned in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyUpBlock"},{"type":"text","text":" callback of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RFIDBleManager.shared.setKeyEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" when the scan key is lifted;"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"When KeyMode = 1, the key value 3 will be returned in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyDownBlock"},{"type":"text","text":" callback of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RFIDBleManager.shared.setKeyEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" when the scan key is pressed, and